  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十六年七月二十七日的下午，风声很紧，我们从西郊搬到西单牌楼左近胡同里朋友的屋子里。",
      "output_sha256": "6384a87dbe76fed0dae1a5ea4508efe89ccadfccd74a2c27949638af7c019601",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "6384a87dbe76fed0dae1a5ea4508efe89ccadfccd74a2c27949638af7c019601",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "朋友全家回南，只住着他的一位同乡和几个仆人。",
      "output_sha256": "8b0c3f4a57f3a8188009ca3c0a07527f64727cca4a7a06945a39645d3e6c57f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "8b0c3f4a57f3a8188009ca3c0a07527f64727cca4a7a06945a39645d3e6c57f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们进了城，城门就关上了。",
      "output_sha256": "be5fe2d455eee9c74456518dd2df44409c582e1bd9f63b90f7ed80f7a7082857",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "be5fe2d455eee9c74456518dd2df44409c582e1bd9f63b90f7ed80f7a7082857",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "街上有点乱，但是大体上还平静。",
      "output_sha256": "a677b4588f7c84e18aaafea0940d3c29c8bb20d54bb83bc49c4715985eaa07e5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "a677b4588f7c84e18aaafea0940d3c29c8bb20d54bb83bc49c4715985eaa07e5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "听说敌方向北平当局发出了最后通牒，要求在二十八日之前作出回应，实际上就是逼迫我们投降。",
      "output_sha256": "5950c60762104b8a08ded057011097cb3a16cc4dcc9fabd8ef2bedc8381f0902",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.454855,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a97a5a5359d7b3b5c03d62d2e63d98ef97b9e7025947957843a0dd1a7737f50f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5950c60762104b8a08ded057011097cb3a16cc4dcc9fabd8ef2bedc8381f0902",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要不然，二十八日他们便要动手。",
      "output_sha256": "5ad29f42fea3006a95cc9d71cca306defa7886c14eb8d21f0d3d9c2c2ef1e2fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "5ad29f42fea3006a95cc9d71cca306defa7886c14eb8d21f0d3d9c2c2ef1e2fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们那时虽然还猜不透当局的意思。",
      "output_sha256": "f2f3241c391b414339542089134f2febd43927d751d371c180f38659ca76e248",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "f2f3241c391b414339542089134f2febd43927d751d371c180f38659ca76e248",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是看光景，背城一战是不可免的。",
      "output_sha256": "97456a3fa06adf958574e6591f0a940cf6c23d0f972efbb93204f01a8edfc170",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "97456a3fa06adf958574e6591f0a940cf6c23d0f972efbb93204f01a8edfc170",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十八日那一天，在床上便听见隆隆的声音。",
      "output_sha256": "0c4db8f167f0d0bd357da0007f0eb82cbbe0433249544d1b6969acd60592752d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c4db8f167f0d0bd357da0007f0eb82cbbe0433249544d1b6969acd60592752d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们猜测，这可能是轰炸西苑兵营的声音。",
      "output_sha256": "9d08bb2d24c779b2bc3cb4f9b93607a45074663d4b98bdd6df68c5950d8adf0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.547941,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f01ac3917c0dd8b440f2e1f62cd38241f0f3c51c6346759d1a654b8eca4ef36f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9d08bb2d24c779b2bc3cb4f9b93607a45074663d4b98bdd6df68c5950d8adf0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "急忙起床，前往胡同口买报。",
      "output_sha256": "209a8593bc2afebe7e1de7d26aa39fc63755be7aeaec29dd2ac3c82a7b6ee43e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.545455,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b42f08a20eec6d3d075e40313e3a4b33218b97a46f7c3a8d3c428a7016084e86"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "209a8593bc2afebe7e1de7d26aa39fc63755be7aeaec29dd2ac3c82a7b6ee43e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "胡同口正冲着西长安街。",
      "output_sha256": "d67447a8dab8f109a2c083d7d328bc407378590f247e707517cb8b16f065905a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "d67447a8dab8f109a2c083d7d328bc407378590f247e707517cb8b16f065905a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这儿有西城到东城的电车道，可是这当儿两头都不见电车的影子。",
      "output_sha256": "edc59cd4f81bf71d93c0a5941251ac137c47735db2bd583402a7b8f9a94b8b8a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "edc59cd4f81bf71d93c0a5941251ac137c47735db2bd583402a7b8f9a94b8b8a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只剩两条电车轨在闪闪的发光。",
      "output_sha256": "4589fff5cdb89e50bdafa9a441cbf595b4093271085a63c48adfb7d5bf335bf3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "4589fff5cdb89e50bdafa9a441cbf595b4093271085a63c48adfb7d5bf335bf3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "街上洋车也少，行人也少。",
      "output_sha256": "3427ca4081f7906bd62bf9ebea354175a9e6fd41aa155f5fb63dcb84b58d5d3d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "3427ca4081f7906bd62bf9ebea354175a9e6fd41aa155f5fb63dcb84b58d5d3d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那么长一条街，显得空空的，静静的。",
      "output_sha256": "324fd93eac26b55f073b418f48ce91fd7ee8bb9cff2467c05534cd4a9b4ac6c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "324fd93eac26b55f073b418f48ce91fd7ee8bb9cff2467c05534cd4a9b4ac6c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "胡同口街两侧的人行道上却站着不少人，东张西望，默不作声，似乎在等待什么消息。",
      "output_sha256": "3b3d3fc448d1ccae30af5a557017a5c68de225dace55cc08bbc86d2518817aeb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.588848,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e97613884328d37c308b795614dc63dd4f6157ddd5109ab4101334b917225377"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3b3d3fc448d1ccae30af5a557017a5c68de225dace55cc08bbc86d2518817aeb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "街中间有一名警察面色凝重，沉默不语。",
      "output_sha256": "a0d0fe3da3c422b0b0baa0354a15e2ae061cd39567583574933c0893a78c9783",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.479373,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "08f01c809cbe2a4a891a6610f851567a83bf3ede92e981565eef68894deb614c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a0d0fe3da3c422b0b0baa0354a15e2ae061cd39567583574933c0893a78c9783",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一位骑车的警察向他低语了几句，随后匆匆骑走了。",
      "output_sha256": "10bc54806a1efd9ecac255313a28bfe0f61361362acfb4f0794f139439cc6fbe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.519488,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e75e52147a439f5e1e4ca9788dd401eed8d283f430ca375e2f8dfad1511affb1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "10bc54806a1efd9ecac255313a28bfe0f61361362acfb4f0794f139439cc6fbe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "报纸上显示我们已经决定迎战。",
      "output_sha256": "e7976eb8514f26c8fb784d57c4157d6a34ad162d87a1345a014d7776ea709a7f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.396016,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c17d7b079c97957a05acf4464e8b2c2d5de63697e1cbfd1de38b3c187daf55cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e7976eb8514f26c8fb784d57c4157d6a34ad162d87a1345a014d7776ea709a7f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我匆匆拿着报看着回到住的地方。",
      "output_sha256": "56eb61a7678fa16679aadc585767699b41e0e087fbdd9dbc66acc79a7a1233f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "56eb61a7678fa16679aadc585767699b41e0e087fbdd9dbc66acc79a7a1233f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "隆隆的声音还在稀疏的响着。",
      "output_sha256": "57a86fff1066489c239cd333f6c75c86232b2268776fc5bd3f3f1ad686af4c07",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "57a86fff1066489c239cd333f6c75c86232b2268776fc5bd3f3f1ad686af4c07",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "午饭匆匆的吃了。",
      "output_sha256": "365981cd5a748e737d950dfd94db987949138b0c171a4bac647d425b81c40bda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "365981cd5a748e737d950dfd94db987949138b0c171a4bac647d425b81c40bda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "门口接二连三的叫“号外！",
      "output_sha256": "c25931ea89e79db1ae97aa5847a6bab25ad588aaf969b59c803438202d8a90d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "c25931ea89e79db1ae97aa5847a6bab25ad588aaf969b59c803438202d8a90d0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "号外！”",
      "output_sha256": "df1e1bd37defb8c8fcfd0ac8eed5d791e67d6e56e7fafedd6c788486abb2bd45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "df1e1bd37defb8c8fcfd0ac8eed5d791e67d6e56e7fafedd6c788486abb2bd45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "买进来抢着看，起先说咱们抢回丰台，抢回天津老站了，后来说咱们抢回廊坊了，最后说咱们打进通州了。",
      "output_sha256": "90327c140c0362d23513b0c75b33da166e28ac09956660f72e6c0ae13cd42b7e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "90327c140c0362d23513b0c75b33da166e28ac09956660f72e6c0ae13cd42b7e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "整个下午，屋里的电话铃声此起彼伏，有的朋友在报告消息，有的在询问情况。",
      "output_sha256": "24b79bb0dca4d3dec119a6b9ffb25fbff56a69636fa54d7726fdc04ef5f77b4a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.589789,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3942b06e25b5e5a01b0633b3260e765b2d8547908b2fb657c4ad4386777c6af8",
        "64c59219cefc9fd32399af42f23773d68ff8c9a2f05af2925fc89b93e36d51db"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "24b79bb0dca4d3dec119a6b9ffb25fbff56a69636fa54d7726fdc04ef5f77b4a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "报告的消息来自地方政府或外交界，内容与“号外”相差无几。",
      "output_sha256": "5e654c82b4b97c0ae05b3cd1649b62056f3d4c2b4fdfc4386c2e64d72190a9c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.478725,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "352aade523edb09a98003bf2b4f5bde5173643fd4430f172517c2c83ab0c4f23"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5e654c82b4b97c0ae05b3cd1649b62056f3d4c2b4fdfc4386c2e64d72190a9c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们忙着浏览号外，耳朵也在紧盯着电话，心中无比欢喜。",
      "output_sha256": "339b90ecfe17367b0b0101a417b5fec229736e8153a44b03567d5f4f7f663a4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.474673,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "089ceab26da4f652a712b73cd58d21debaa3431593115d84ef18560b03242a05"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "339b90ecfe17367b0b0101a417b5fec229736e8153a44b03567d5f4f7f663a4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "六点钟的样子，忽然有一架飞机嗡嗡的出现在高空中。",
      "output_sha256": "9f1ee80ed3a73ebb8eb0d5fe436dddfeffdb0a1efd9833d7c32bc9f997c63618",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "9f1ee80ed3a73ebb8eb0d5fe436dddfeffdb0a1efd9833d7c32bc9f997c63618",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大家纷纷走出院子仰头观看，想知道是否是我们中央的飞机。",
      "output_sha256": "bccf9e856ccf1b28478b068631c1d1a8ef78cdca231602215cc7c956a8649a31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
