      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "飞机绕着弯儿，随着弯儿，均匀的撒着一搭一搭的纸片儿，像个长尾巴似的。",
      "output_sha256": "f4babb3aeff06e19d2293b888bcf1d09c4320282f2c408917a331e915bafb171",
